    "title": "Portal:Current events/2026 November 15",
    "pageid": 84790747,
    "text": "<li><a href=\"/wiki/Middle_Eastern_crisis_(2023%E2%80%93present)\" title=\"Middle Eastern crisis (2023–present)\">Middle Eastern crisis</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Iran_war\" title=\"2026 Iran war\">2026 Iran war</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2026_Strait_of_Hormuz_crisis\" title=\"2026 Strait of Hormuz crisis\">2026 Strait of Hormuz crisis</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_ships_attacked_during_the_2026_Iran_war\" title=\"List of ships attacked during the 2026 Iran war\">Ships attacked during the 2026 Iran war</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Iran\" title=\"Iran\">Iran</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Islamic_Revolutionary_Guard_Corps\" title=\"Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps\">Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps</a> says that a <a href=\"/wiki/Oil_tanker#The_supertanker_era\" title=\"Oil tanker\">supertanker</a> carrying two million <a href=\"/wiki/Barrel_(unit)#Oil_barrel\" title=\"Barrel (unit)\">barrels of oil</a> has sunk in the <a href=\"/wiki/Strait_of_Hormuz\" title=\"Strait of Hormuz\">Strait of Hormuz</a> after striking a mine. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.arabnews.com/middle-east/iran-says-supertanker-with-2-million-barrels-of-oil-sank-in-gulf-3012053\">(AFP via <i>Arab News</i>)</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>"
  }
